        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "8.4(a)(2)b Refuse a formal offer from the Company for a full-time job within the bargaining unit or in the same labor market area from which laid off, for which the salary or level offered is equal to or greater than the employee's salary at the time of layoff plus the inflation adjustment in effect at the time of layoff, or",
