        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "8.4(a)(4) Laid-off employees who are prevented from meeting the conditions described in 8.4(a)(2)a, 8.4(a)(2)b or 8.4(a)(2)c solely due to medical disability, verified to the Company's satisfaction by their personal physician, shall upon request be granted a waiver for the missed requirement(s).",
