        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "8.4(b)(1) It is a mutual objective of the Company and the Union that laid-off employees who have not been determined ineligible under 8.4(b)(3), 21.3(a), or 8.5 be recalled to active employment, and a mutual desire that such recall into the Major Organization from which the employee was laid off be offered in approximate reverse order of layoff. Accordingly, employees on file for recall pursuant to 8.4(b)(4) will be offered return to active employment within the applicable Retention Group in approximate reverse order of layoff, prior to workforce additions from sources external to the Company, subject to the following limitations:",
